{
  "title": "GrandNode \u2014 marketplace (1,903\u2605)",
  "content": "Project: GrandNode\nDomain: marketplace | Scale: large | Stars: 1,903\nProblem: Provides an open-source, headless, multi-tenant eCommerce platform that allows businesses to build and manage online stores with flexible NoSQL storage and cloud-native deployment options.\nTarget users: eCommerce developers, online retailers, marketplace operators, system integrators, SMBs and enterprises needing self-hosted storefronts\nCore features: Multi-tenant store management; Headless CMS and storefront capabilities; Shopping cart and checkout workflow; Product catalog and inventory management; Marketplace and vendor support; Containerized deployment via Docker; Vue.js-based frontend theming\nIntegrations: MongoDB, AWS DocumentDB, Azure CosmosDB, Docker\nTech stack: Vue.js, HTML, CSS, JavaScript + ASP.NET Core (C#) + MongoDB / AWS DocumentDB / Azure CosmosDB + Docker\nKey libraries: ASP.NET Core MVC, Vue.js\nArchitecture: monolith\nDesign lessons:\n- Uses a NoSQL document database (MongoDB and cloud equivalents) to achieve schema flexibility and horizontal scalability for product/catalog data.\n- Headless architecture decouples the storefront from the backend, enabling API-first integrations and custom front-end implementations.\n- Multi-tenancy is a first-class concern, allowing a single deployment to serve multiple independent stores.\n- This repository represents a legacy codebase that was superseded by a ground-up rewrite (GrandNode 2.0), highlighting the value of planned architectural migrations over incremental patching.",
